# A short grating does not radiate everything: 1 - exp(-leakage x length).
# Reference: closed form.
title Uniform grating 5 um long
grating angle=10 length=5
leak 0.14
expect radiated 0.50341470 1e-06
expect overlap 0.64756907 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.16299789 2e-05
expect position 2.34066582 0.005
expect radiated 0.50341470 1e-6
